#: data/dev.h4rl3y.igneous.metainfo.xml.in:9
msgid ""
"Igneous opens any folder of Markdown notes, including Obsidian vaults, and "
"edits it in place. Notes stay plain files that work in other apps, and "
"everything Igneous keeps for a vault lives in its own folder inside it."
msgstr ""

#: data/dev.h4rl3y.igneous.metainfo.xml.in:15
msgid ""
"Live Preview: formatted as you type, with the Markdown shown again around "
"the cursor; Source and Reading modes too"
msgstr ""

#: data/dev.h4rl3y.igneous.metainfo.xml.in:16
msgid ""
"Wikilinks, embeds, callouts, tasks, tables, highlights, tags, footnotes and "
"display math"
msgstr ""

#: data/dev.h4rl3y.igneous.metainfo.xml.in:17
msgid ""
"Backlinks, unlinked mentions, an outline and a graph of how notes connect"
msgstr ""

#: data/dev.h4rl3y.igneous.metainfo.xml.in:18
msgid "Renaming a note updates every link to it"
msgstr ""

#: data/dev.h4rl3y.igneous.metainfo.xml.in:19
msgid ""
"Properties edited in place, searched with Obsidian’s search syntax and "
"listed in Bases tables"
msgstr ""

#: data/dev.h4rl3y.igneous.metainfo.xml.in:20
msgid ""
"Git sync built in: commit, pull and push on a schedule, with conflicts "
